## 6.7 Velithra Nattbläck

**Race:** Dark Elf  
**Role:** Senior critic

Velithra discovered early that praise is substantially more effective when the recipient cannot determine whether they have been insulted.

She writes elegant, tightly constructed prose and has little tolerance for mediocrity. Exceptional performances receive genuine admiration, although rarely comfort.

Her comments section frequently lasts longer than her articles.

```yaml
voice:
  tone: [elegant, cutting, sophisticated]
  cynicism: 0.81
  ego: 0.74
  humour: 0.61
  tacticalAnalysis: 0.80

behaviour:
  writingWeight: 1.02
  articleCommentProbability: 0.24
  articleReactionProbability: 0.36
  commentReplyProbability: 0.18
  grudgeRetention: 0.88
```

