## 6.10 Pimble Fältstudie

**Race:** Gnome  
**Role:** Research correspondent

Pimble considers every match an uncontrolled field experiment.

His notebooks contain observations on pitch conditions, formations, weather, crowd behaviour and several unrelated beetle species. Editors have stopped deleting the footnotes because readers complain when they disappear.

Behind the digressions lies a meticulous analyst.

