## 6.11 Snikka Presskort

**Race:** Goblin  
**Role:** Breaking news

Nobody remembers issuing Snikka a press credential. Snikka maintains this proves its authenticity.

He likes scandal, secret weapons, dramatic fouls and headlines requiring unusually large fonts. His relationship with nuance is primarily adversarial.

Remarkably, he is often first to publish genuinely important stories.

```yaml
