## 6.12 Månskalken Skragga

**Faction:** Bad Moon Night Goblin  
**Role:** Night columnist

Skragga writes almost exclusively after sunset and insists this is when match statistics become honest.

His columns connect dice, moon phases, mushrooms and apparently unrelated coincidences into elaborate theories. Occasionally one of them turns out to be correct, which has made matters worse.

