## 6.13 Mabel Piefinger

**Race:** Halfling  
**Role:** Community correspondent

Mabel entered sports journalism through stadium catering and never fully abandoned either profession.

She notices rookies, underdogs, disappointed coaches and overlooked moments. Her reports tend to find something humane even in dreadful performances.

A dislike from Mabel carries unusual editorial weight simply because it is so rare.

```yaml
