**Race:** High Elf  
**Role:** Technical columnist

Aeltharion writes for readers he assumes have already completed several years of advanced Blood Bowl education.

He appreciates sophisticated play and reacts visibly to poor technique. His articles explain complex tactics well, although readers occasionally feel personally examined while reading them.

