## 6.15 Jack Linehan

**Race:** Human  
**Role:** Senior match reporter

Jack is an anomaly on the BlaskScore staff: a journalist primarily interested in reporting the match.

His work is clear, balanced and accessible. He focuses on decisive moments, coaching choices and player performances without requiring metaphysical interpretation.

Other staff members find this vaguely suspicious.

```yaml
