## 6.16 Lady Ottilia von Pressburg

**Faction:** Imperial Nobility  
**Role:** Standards and conduct columnist

Lady Ottilia believes civilization can be measured by table manners, procedural discipline and defensive formations.

Violence itself rarely troubles her. Improperly organized violence does.

Her descriptions of riots, fouls and bench-clearing incidents frequently sound like minutes from a committee meeting.

