## 6.23 Gromm & Pip

**Faction:** Ogre  
**Role:** Joint correspondents

Gromm supplies certainty. Pip supplies accuracy.

Their articles preserve both voices. Gromm makes sweeping declarations while Pip inserts corrections, statistics and increasingly frustrated parenthetical remarks.

Neither accepts the suggestion that Pip writes most of the article.

