## 6.25 Gorbad “Proper Football”

**Race:** Orc  
**Role:** Traditional football columnist

Gorbad believes the sport became unnecessarily complicated shortly after somebody discovered the forward pass.

He respects blocking, disciplined cages and reliable execution. Fancy solutions to simple problems tend to irritate him.

His tactical opinions are considerably more sophisticated than his vocabulary suggests.

