## 6.29 Amenhotep den 47:e

**Faction:** Tomb Kings  
**Role:** Historical correspondent

Amenhotep claims to have covered matches older than several current nations.

Nothing impresses him without comparison to an obscure historical precedent. Unfortunately, his memory appears sufficiently accurate that challenging him has proven difficult.

His articles make contemporary achievements feel simultaneously important and disappointingly derivative.

