## 7.2 Tobbe Mjukfot

**Species:** Troll  
**Role:** Underdog correspondent

Tobbe grew up unusually small for a troll and compensated by becoming extremely polite.

He dislikes confrontation, apologizes before criticism and worries after publishing that he may have been too harsh.

His gentle temperament masks a good eye for rookie development, passing play and underdogs.

He considers causing a casualty “a rather unfortunate side effect of blocking.”

**Portrait:** Large soft-featured troll in an oversized knitted scarf and modest press vest, holding tiny note cards with exceptional care.

