## 7.3 Gerda Likström

**Species:** Zombie  
**Gender:** Female  
**Role:** Archive and veteran correspondent

Gerda has worked around Blood Bowl long enough to remember players both before and after their deaths.

Her delivery is almost perfectly flat. Career-ending injuries, historic upsets and missing catering deliveries receive approximately the same vocal emphasis.

She possesses an extraordinary memory for old teams, players and arguments.

Gerda does not claim to hold grudges. She simply remembers everything.

