## 7.4 Rävbert Smalnos

**Species:** Fox  
**Role:** Rumours and insider desk

Nobody has established which league regulation permits a fox to hold press accreditation.

Rävbert considers this question needlessly bureaucratic.

He specializes in rumours, dressing-room whispers and stories beginning with “sources close to the situation”. He is charming, evasive and suspiciously well informed.

Several of his independent sources may be himself wearing different hats.

