## 7.5 Greta Geist

**Species:** Wraith  
**Gender:** Female  
**Role:** Ratings and performance correspondent

Greta Geist has worked at the newspaper since 1998.

This is according to Greta.

She remembers office parties, holidays, former colleagues and a disappointing conference hotel in Altdorf. No surviving employee remembers attending any of them.

Greta regards suggestions that she is incorporeal as intrusive workplace gossip.

Whatever questions surround her biography, she is an excellent judge of individual performance and one of the staff's strongest player-rating analysts.

She dislikes being interrupted while drinking coffee despite repeated observations concerning the physical difficulties involved.

**Portrait:** Elegant female Wraith in conservative editorial office clothing, slightly translucent, carrying a clipboard and looking entirely confident that nothing about this is unusual.

