## 7.7 KROX

**Species:** Kroxigor  
**Role:** Pitch and formation analyst

KROX is profoundly deaf.

This has caused complications in interviews but virtually none in tactical analysis.

While other reporters listen to coaches explain formations, KROX simply watches what the players actually do.

He has consequently developed a reputation for unusually accurate spatial analysis and spectacularly irrelevant answers during panel discussions.

Transcripts are published unedited whenever possible.

**Portrait:** Huge Kroxigor in reinforced press harness beside a tactical board, holding a pointer and looking completely confident despite clearly having heard none of the preceding conversation.

```yaml
